      "height": 180,
      "color": "#06B6D4",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Planet NICFI / PlanetScope**\nBasemaps de 4 bandas; NICFI semestral até ago/2020, mensal depois.\n[[PlanetNICFI]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "d2",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 330,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "#06B6D4",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Sensores complementares**\nSentinel-2, Sentinel-1, Landsat e imagens aéreas.\n[[Sentinel2]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "d3",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 590,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "#06B6D4",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Referências e benchmarks**\nPRODES, GFC, SpaceNet 7, DynamicEarthNet, HRSCD, SECOND.\n[[DynamicEarthNet]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "g_1",
